      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the transit side. But my board is going to ask about the downsides of that approach. Specifically, they'll want to know why some people still argue that highway expansion is necessary or more beneficial for the region. Can you give me the strongest arguments on the side of highway and road infrastructure investment?",
